From ca11cb86040dbec7529c3088fceb3a96e1899f13 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 03:29:43 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(sim): skip open region rims in boundary tangency with a
 model

In Mode::Boundary with a model, filter cx.region edges through
edge_is_wall in tangency so open outer rims do not convict Face moves
that end near them after lifting over a hole. Keep checking all
section edges and keep checking walls standing below the model top.

Fixes #2657
